			"type":"text",
			"text":"* onboarding org or defining org structure\n\t* plumbing job \n\t\t* strategy\n\t\t\t* vision\n\t\t\t* goals\n\t* sync job (weekly)\n\t\t* execution\n\t\t\t* milestone\n\t\t\t* task\n\t\t\t* subtask",
